From 8cfdcf360faaa96e8a869a05c5a2c18624446b50 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WeiguangTWK <weiguangtwk@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 19:22:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Neko LineageOS: [ASTER] Gate customized Keystore generation
 on current permits

Add the integrity monitor and lease checks used by TEE Soft Emu. Disable the
effective customization configuration when no current platform permit exists.

Guard customized key generation before it starts and recheck the permit before
storing the result. If authorization changes, attempt to delete the uncommitted
key through its original KeyMint device and reject the generation.

Restrict certificate-chain customization to the guarded generation path and
include the monitor's Rust and offline model tests.

